{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 549,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Check this out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3189,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hahaha, isn't that awesome? That is hydrodynamic levitation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10570,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Check it out!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17590,
    "dDurationMs": 3979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This styrofoam ball is levitating on this stream of water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21570,
    "dDurationMs": 5219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's doing so in a very stable way. The set up it's so stable you can play Frisbee through it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28539,
    "dDurationMs": 3559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which is weird to me because the water is off to one side of the ball"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32099,
    "dDurationMs": 5069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that doesn't seem to make any sense, cause you can block the water for a second and the ball will still levitate, have a look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38530,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't that cool?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57480,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How can it be stable like this? How can this be a stable configuration?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62020,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is what we're gonna explain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64449,
    "dDurationMs": 1161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is my friend Blake"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65610,
    "dDurationMs": 4349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He is a toy inventor, and he actually came up with this and he brought it to me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69960,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like \"That is awesome, there's some really cool physics going on here.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73400,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Juggling with water. I can't believe it will"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78100,
    "dDurationMs": 4639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just allow you to switch balls like that. They can even hit each other as they go down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82740,
    "dDurationMs": 3419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't take the other one off the stream. So how does this effect work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86500,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well a lot of people might think of the hairdryer ping-pong ball effect. Which works basically based on Bernoulli's principle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93400,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's actually what we're showing here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95130,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've brought this stream down so it's going at a very low velocity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98640,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's pretty much laminar flow, and what you can see, if you look at the ball, is it's entirely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105220,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enclosed in water, so that water stream comes up, goes around the ball and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109900,
    "dDurationMs": 1399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just as with the ping-pong ball"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111300,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it moves to one side of the stream it slows down the flow of fluid, and according to Bernoulli's principle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116440,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This increases the pressure relative to the faster flowing fluid on the other side"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120490,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it pushes the ball back into the middle. That is what provides the stability for this ball."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125530,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think what we're seeing with the bigger balls is something different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129000,
    "dDurationMs": 5219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the largest styrofoam ball I could find, so I don't expect it to work, but hey we're gonna give it a shot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135280,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should I go higher?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137800,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139920,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's happening!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146560,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is incredible! Look at it dance on there man!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150120,
    "dDurationMs": 7300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like got this instability, but it corrects. It's incredible! You should see the way the water is spiraling off there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158110,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is awesome!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179760,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I've been thinking a lot about the physics that makes this possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183460,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I think is happening is as the stream contacts the ball"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187440,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It pushes it up, but it also pushes the ball out, away from the stream"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192160,
    "dDurationMs": 7300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so what I think is remarkable is that the ball actually will stay there. It is in a stable configuration and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199460,
    "dDurationMs": 7940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From looking at the high-speed footage what I really think is going on is this water is getting thrown over and down by the ball"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207600,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and since the ball is putting a force over and down on the water that water is putting a force up and in on the ball"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213320,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which keeps it right in that stream"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215520,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's because there's a bit of adhesion between the water here and the styrofoam. Starts to go a little slower"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220600,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That pulls all that water over the ball"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223240,
    "dDurationMs": 2389,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's the start of how you get the ball to spin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226180,
    "dDurationMs": 7459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how you get that sprayed down on the right-hand side which provides more lift and keeps forcing the ball back into the stream"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234460,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237100,
    "dDurationMs": 7339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "once the ball is levitating it remains stable because if it drifts too far into the stream that decreases the flow of water around the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244440,
    "dDurationMs": 2489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ball reducing the force pushing it into the stream"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246930,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if it drifts too far out that increases the water flow over the ball increasing the force pushing it back into the stream"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254140,
    "dDurationMs": 7070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what makes the equilibrium position so stable. Any slight perturbation creates a restoring force that moves the ball back to equilibrium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261960,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rotation I think is also nice because that gives it that angular momentum"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266780,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Providing a little bit of stability side by side, that's not so important for these balls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271480,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it certainly is important for the disc. If you try to levitate a disc you need to keep it in the right orientation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281000,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, yes!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283740,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Getting the discs to levitate is significantly harder than the balls because they have to maintain their vertical orientation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289860,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In order for this to work. Even a slight breeze makes this very difficult"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306660,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "HEY! Check that out! Can you come in and get it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314420,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh my goodness"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319680,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a clear demonstration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321729,
    "dDurationMs": 5779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that that is not just about the Bernoulli effect, right? It's due to the rotation of the disc that actually carries the water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327669,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over and sprays it down which pushes that back into the stream. That's amazing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333909,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only is this an awesome experiment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336029,
    "dDurationMs": 4331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's also pretty fun to play around with in the summer, and it was invented by my friend Blake"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340360,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So come over my channel Innovinci"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342340,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'll show you how, with a simple Home Depot run, you can build this in your own backyard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346420,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll put a link to that video right here. So if you want to make this, go check it out"
    } ]
  } ]
}
